    "title": "Inside The Life And Death Of Shannon Hoon, The Troubled Lead Singer Of Blind Melon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Austin Harvey ,\n5 hours ago Shannon Hoon was just 28 when he overdosed on cocaine in his band's tour bus after a years-long struggle with addiction. Blind Melon was supposed to play a show in New Orleans on Oct. 21, 1995. Their tour bus was parked on St. Charles Avenue, and the band’s energetic frontman, Shannon Hoon, was lying inside. But he wasn’t resting between performances. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
